# Build artefact - attach it to a GitHub Release instead of committing it.
# Anchored to the repo root and requiring a digit, because git on Windows matches
# ignore patterns CASE-INSENSITIVELY: the old `ifs-sticky-notes-*.zip` also matched
# deploy/IFS-STICKY-NOTES-LU.zip and silently kept the entity package out of the repo.
/ifs-sticky-notes-[0-9]*.zip

# The raw capture still contains real customer data (name, site, order no).
# Only the masked composite in store-assets/ may be published.
store-assets/source-capture.png
